[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1686","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0843","title":"Samba pam_smb 和 pam_ntdom PAM 认证模块缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"pam_smb 和 pam_ntdom 可插拔认证模块（PAM）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长用户名进行登录认证，触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响使用 SMB 和 NT 域认证的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低，可导致目标系统完全失陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0843"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34Z","remediation":"升级 pam_smb 至 1.1.7 及以上版本（Debian 已发布 DSA-20000911 安全更新，Mandrake Linux 发布 MDKSA-2000-047 补丁）。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/pam.d/ 配置中移除 pam_smb.so 和 pam_ntdom.so 模块，或通过 hosts.allow/deny 限制 SMB 认证服务的来源 IP 范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0073.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0114.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000911","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-047.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv8_draht_pam_smb_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1666","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0843","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2000/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0843.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-