0882.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0882.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0992.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0991","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0991.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0879","title":"LPPlus LPPlus 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"LPPlus 套件中的 dccsched、dcclpdser、dccbkst、dccshut、dcclpdshut 及 dccbkstshut 等多个程序被错误地设置为 setuid root 且对全体用户可执行，导致任意本地用户均可利用这些程序启动或停止 LPD 打印服务，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可触发，无需身份认证，影响系统可用性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0879"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39Z","remediation":"立即移除受影响程序（dccsched、dcclpdser、dccbkst、dccshut、dcclpdshut、dccbkstshut）的 setuid root 权限：执行 `chmod u-s /path/to/dccsched /path/to/dcclpdser /path/to/dccbkst /path/to/dccshut /path/to/dcclpdshut /path/to/dccbkstshut`，并将可执行权限限制为仅授权管理员可运行（`chmod 700`）。如 LPPlus 版本支持，建议升级到厂商修复版本或应用官方安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0531.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1643","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5199","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0879","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5ed23ad1e6e5869267a4c8091cffdf6711227b5/2000/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0879.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0879.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0879.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0991.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0990","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0990.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0878","title":"Web 服务器 mailto CGI 脚本远程命令执行漏洞","description":"mailto CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 emailadd 表单字段中注入 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用 mailto CGI 脚本的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可导致服务器被完全控制、敏感信息泄露或进一步横向移动。由于 CGI 脚本未对用户输入进行充分过滤，攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0878"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:39Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上存在漏洞的 mailto CGI 脚本，停止使用该脚本处理邮件表单提交。改用经过输入验证的邮件发送程序（如使用 PHP 的 mail() 函数配合 filter_var 对 email 参数做严格过滤），对所有用户输入中的 shell 元字符（; | & ` $ ( ) { } < >）进行转义或拒绝。如无法替换脚本，在 Web 服务器配置中限制该 CGI 脚本的执行权限，并禁用 CGI 目录的 Execute 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1669","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5241","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0878.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0878.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f04